load @term/seed/group
  find group

# A gauge group: the symmetry group of a force, the transformations of the internal fields that leave the physics
# unchanged. The Standard Model's forces are the circle group (electromagnetism), the special unitary group of order two
# (the weak force), and of order three (the strong force). In the substrate these internal symmetries are emergent, the
# coarse-grained shadow of the discrete cell symmetry. The form carries the underlying group.
form gauge-group
  link group, like group
